# Notebooks

This folder contains Jupyter Notebooks used for the Zomato Delivery Analytics project.

## Purpose

The notebooks provide an interactive environment for performing:

- Data loading and inspection
- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- KPI calculation
- Data visualization
- Feature engineering
- Predictive modeling

## Files

### zomato_logistics_analysis.ipynb

This notebook contains the complete workflow of the project, including:

1. Importing libraries
2. Loading the dataset
3. Data cleaning
4. Handling missing values
5. Outlier detection
6. Feature engineering
7. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
8. KPI analysis
9. Delay prediction model
10. Results and insights

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Jupyter Notebook

## Output

The notebook generates:
- Statistical summaries
- KPI metrics
- Visualizations and charts
- Machine learning model results
- Business insights for logistics optimization

## Project Objective

The goal of this notebook is to analyze Zomato delivery operations data and identify factors affecting delivery performance, operational efficiency, and customer satisfaction.
